{"path":"locale/locale/operator=","title":"std::locale::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::locale::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/locale/operator=","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"Creates a copy of other, replacing the contents of *this. The reference counts of all facets held by other are incremented.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev\">\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx11\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> locale<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> locale<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">throw</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> locale<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> locale<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Creates a copy of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>, replacing the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>. The reference counts of all facets held by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> are incremented. The reference counts of all facets previously held by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> are decremented, and those facets whose reference count becomes zero are deleted.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>, which is now a copy of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/locale\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a new locale <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"},{"path":"locale/locale","title":"std::locale"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::locale::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: until C++11, since C++11. Creates a copy of other, replacing the contents of *this."},{"label":"Return value","note":"Returns *this, which is now a copy of other."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs a new locale"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":91,"codeBlockCount":0}
